WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,440 --> 00:00:02,040
I'm a doctor, doctor

2
00:00:02,040 --> 00:00:03,000
not a nurse

3
00:00:05,020 --> 00:00:07,620
It turns out you don’t even know how to work as a nurse.

4
00:00:08,060 --> 00:00:16,780
I don't know how to do something as simple as dropping water. Don't poke me first. Tell the truth.

5
00:00:17,180 --> 00:00:21,530
Do you know how to acupuncture Bai Yuxing?

6
00:00:21,810 --> 00:00:26,250
If you don't know how, you want to ask me to find someone who knows how to do it. Don't try to show off. Who can show off?

7
00:00:26,370 --> 00:00:27,370
Your sister, Sister Shen Xiu

8
00:00:27,490 --> 00:00:30,370
If you hadn't suddenly scared me, I would have poked you. Stop talking.

9
00:00:30,860 --> 00:00:32,300
If I can't stick a needle in,

10
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:33,260
I will write my resignation letter tomorrow

11
00:00:33,260 --> 00:00:40,700
Let me tell you, just go back and help the old man.

12
00:00:40,860 --> 00:00:41,980
I am a genius

13
00:00:42,220 --> 00:00:45,900
I'll tell you whether I can do such a simple job, Sister Shen Xiu.

14
00:00:46,020 --> 00:00:47,460
I will be your personal doctor

15
00:00:47,460 --> 00:00:48,420
It's just Qu Cai

16
00:00:48,540 --> 00:00:49,660
Just have fun secretly

17
00:00:50,470 --> 00:00:51,390
I'll give you a raise

18
00:00:53,570 --> 00:00:54,850
Sister Shen Xiu, you did it on purpose?

19
00:00:55,090 --> 00:00:56,810
I'll help you cure your little girlfriend

20
00:00:56,930 --> 00:00:58,090
You also deliberately disparaged me
